      "content": "it just feels so lonely though. like every time i look at the bed or see something he would've loved, it's just this massive reminder that i'm alone. it's not just sadness, it's like my whole reason for being here died with him. how am i supposed to just \"find myself\" when the person who actually knew me is gone?",
